-- Chinese trial decks (Macau) are the alpha decks; English trial decks (Gen Con 2025) are the beta decks with today's layout. Safe to run more than once.
update promo_items set data = jsonb_set(data,'{inf}', to_jsonb($j$English-language Project K trial-deck version of this legend. These came inside the English Project K trial decks (Viktor, Jinx, Volibear, Yasuo) handed out at Gen Con in 2025. They are the beta trial decks, which use the card layout the game has today. Same card as the Chinese Macau alpha version, but in English, non-foil and with SAMPLE printed across the front.$j$ || substr(data->>'inf', position(chr(10)||chr(10)||'Grading heads-up:' in data->>'inf')))) where id in ('item-10670','item-10671','item-10672','item-10673');
update promo_items set data = jsonb_set(data,'{inf}', to_jsonb($j$Project K trial-deck version of this legend. These came inside the Chinese Project K trial decks (Viktor, Jinx, Volibear, Yasuo) handed out at the December 2024 Macau event before the game was revealed as Riftbound. They are the alpha trial decks, with the early Project K layout. Same card as the Macau silver-pack promo, but non-foil with SAMPLE printed across the front. Trial-deck cards also turn up on eBay as singles.$j$ || substr(data->>'inf', position(chr(10)||chr(10)||'Grading heads-up:' in data->>'inf')))) where id in ('item-10600','item-10601','item-10602','item-10603');
update promo_items set data = jsonb_set(data,'{ev}', '"Gen Con 2025"') where id in ('item-10670','item-10671','item-10672','item-10673');
